          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Gut Shot"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "Requirements: The gunner is flanked by two or more creatures and the gunner's pistol is loaded\n\nFrequency: 1/round\n\nThe gunner turns their pistol on themself and pulls the trigger, firing through their own gut to catch the foe behind them unawares.\n\nThe gunner makes a flintlock pistol Strike against an adjacent creature, who becomes flat-footed against this Strike. The gunner takes 1d4 piercing damage."
            },
